window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>It’s St. Patrick’s Day and Holly’s feeling lucky…</b></p> <p>At least, right up until a dead body shows up in her backyard.</p> <p>With the townspeople distracted by a mysterious shamrock-themed scavenger hunt, everyone seems content to chalk up the death as a tragic accident in the woods. But when the clover-shaped clues take a menacing turn, it leads some in town to think the murderer might be hiding within the esteemed Beechwood Manor.</p> <p>With a rogue leprechaun causing chaos and dark magic lurking on the edges of town, it’s up to Holly to follow the trail of shamrocks and catch the real killer before suspicion permanently smears her supernatural sanctuary.</p>"; 
